---
import { site } from '../site';
---
<section class="section" id="problem">
  <p class="eyebrow">The problem</p>
  <h2 class="section-title">Mission control is not always one call away.</h2>
  <p class="section-lede">
    On Mars, a message takes up to 20 minutes to travel one way. NASA expects crews to
    solve problems as a team, without immediate help from the ground.
  </p>
  <p>
    A change in an astronaut's health can start in exactly that gap. Monitoring that depends
    on the ground stops working when the link does. Spectra runs the analysis on board, so
    the astronaut gets an answer first and the ground gets the record when communication
    allows.
  </p>
  <p class="source">
    Source: <a href={site.nasaSource.url} rel="noopener">{site.nasaSource.label}</a>
  </p>
</section>
